{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a premium “About Us” section for a Shopify store with a strong private-membership identity.
    The section should feel minimal, exclusive, and editorial — not corporate or friendly.
    
    HERO (TOP OF SECTION)
    - Full-width hero area
    - Headline (large, bold, uppercase):
      PRIVATE CLOTHING. MEMBERS ONLY.
    - Subline (smaller, spaced, muted):
      Entry is granted. Releases are curated.
    - Center-aligned text
    - Add subtle fade-in or slide-up animation on load
    - No buttons in hero
    
    LAYOUT & STRUCTURE
    - Content-based vertical layout
    - Each section clearly separated with spacing
    - Desktop: generous margins and breathing room
    - Mobile: stacked, clean, no clutter
    - No sliders, carousels, or auto-rotating elements
    
    SECTION 1 – WHAT WE ARE
    Title: What We Are
    Content:
    Entitled Club is a private clothing brand built on selection. We handpick menswear that meets a strict
    standard, then release it in controlled drops. We prioritise quality over quantity — so every collection
    feels exclusive by design.
    
    SECTION 2 – HOW ACCESS WORKS
    Title: How Access Works
    Content:
    Access is members-only. To enter, you apply with your details. Approvals are typically granted within
    10–15 days. Once approved, you have always-on access to the storefront.
    
    SECTION 3 – CURATION PHILOSOPHY
    Title: Curation Philosophy
    Content:
    We do not stock at scale. We curate. Our drops are built around scarcity that is real: few pieces, limited
    quantities, and clean selection. We keep the storefront quiet so the product stays primary.
    
    SECTION 4 – AUTHENTICITY & QUALITY
    Title: Authenticity & Quality
    Content:
    We source only through select authentic channels. Every piece is checked for legitimacy and overall
    quality before it is listed. We do not pass on quality rejects or defective inventory.
    
    SECTION 5 – DROPS & ARCHIVE
    Title: Drops & Archive
    Content:
    Most of our releases follow the drop model. A drop opens, members shop, and then the drop closes.
    When it closes, it becomes archive. We do not restock by default. The chapter ends.
    
    SECTION 6 – THE MEANING OF ENTITLED
    Title: The Meaning of Entitled
    Content:
    Entitled is not arrogance. It is authority. It signals confidence, taste, and access — without noise.
    Membership is the boundary between public retail and private selection.
    
    DESIGN & STYLE
    - Background:
      - Soft grey-to-dark-grey gradient
      - Very subtle fabric or textile texture (low opacity)
      - Optional abstract clothing or T-shirt outline texture, barely visible
    - Typography:
      - Serif or modern editorial sans-serif
      - Headings bold and confident
      - Body text calm and readable
    - Color palette:
      - Grey, charcoal, off-white
      - No bright or accent colors
    - Dividers:
      - Thin lines or subtle spacing only
    - Animation:
      - Gentle fade-up animation per section
      - No aggressive motion
    
    EXPERIENCE GOALS
    - Quiet luxury
    - Editorial brand story
    - Clear boundary between public and members-only access
    - No sales language
    - No calls to action inside this section
